# Build Process

The live filesystem was modified using livefs-editor.

Final build actions:

    setup_rootfs

    Disable cdrom repositories

    apt-get update

    Install:
        xserver-xorg
        task-lxqt-desktop
        sddm

    dpkg --configure -a

    apt-get -f install

Additional issue resolved:

Missing temporary directory:

    /home/redwolf/oxide-ubuntu/tmp

This caused xserver package configuration failures.

