# Lessons Learned

Linux distributions are layered systems:

    Kernel
     |
    Boot system
     |
    Filesystem
     |
    Packages
     |
    Display server
     |
    Desktop environment
     |
    User session
     |
    Installer

Each layer has independent requirements.

